      "id": "lean-startup-s031-p00562",
      "source_en": "in consumer electronics. The latest phones and tablet computers are in consumer electronics. The latest phones and tablet computers are little more than a screen connected to the Internet. Almost all of their value is determined by their software. Even old-school products such as automobiles are seeing ever-larger parts of their value being generated by the software they carry inside, which controls everything from the entertainment system to tuning the engine to controlling the brakes. What can be built out of software can be modi ed much faster than a physical or mechanical device can.",
